From 9cd704c79868241ddac0f9d1984a403f1a86fbf6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SuperVM <supervm@localhost>
Date: Tue, 28 Jul 2026 13:43:22 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] feat(castore/fs): serve DAX over vhost-user shmem

Serve setupmapping and removemapping through standard vhost-user shmem
requests, advertising the cache region and device tag. Keep the cache
optional, reject writable mappings, and test descriptor passing over a socket
pair.

Change-Id: I1999de02032feb208bd7af2520cbba1e619f17f6
